msgid "O YouTube exigiu PO Token (Proof of Origin) para reproduzir esta faixa nos clientes web/mweb. Faça login no YouTube Music pelo menu do aplicativo (a opção \"Autenticar\") usando cookies de uma janela privativa do navegador — o cliente \"tv\" usa esses cookies para reproduzir sem PO Token. Se já estiver autenticado, refaça o login com cookies recém-exportados."
msgstr "YouTube required a PO Token (Proof of Origin) to play this track on the web/mweb clients. Log in to YouTube Music from the application menu (the \"Authenticate\" option) using cookies from a private browser window — the \"tv\" client uses those cookies to play without a PO Token. If you are already authenticated, log in again with freshly exported cookies."

