msgstr "yt-dlp found an installed JavaScript runtime, but none of the versions are compatible: {runtimes}. Update to Deno 2.3+ or Node.js 22+; QuickJS 2023-12-9+ and Bun from 1.2.11 through 1.3.14 are also supported."

